      "review_description": "Solar installed in December 2013. Up to installation stage, everything went well.Encountered intermittent fault with Growatt inverter after about 7 months and contacted 'Green Edge Solar' to look at problem. This happened about 8 months ago. Has been given the runaround since with no resolution.Does not return calls and when on the odd occasion I get through, the reply is \"I will get back to you\" or \"I will send someone to check\" and nothing happens.Finally resorted to contact Growatt directly for replacement. Growatt's customer service was excellent. After putting in a claim form, the replacement was delivered within a week and on top of that, they reimbursed up to $150.00 off the installation cost.Potential customers .... be aware.",
